{"vid":"b5ZZjSzv04A","source":"b5ZZjSzv04A.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":5.8,"txt":"- [Narrator] All around the world,"},{"t":7.1,"txt":"millions of motors are coupled"},{"t":8.9,"txt":"to millions of machines."},{"t":11.6,"txt":"Additionally, there are many other examples"},{"t":14,"txt":"of rotating equipment that require shaft alignment."},{"t":17.6,"txt":"The shaft and the motor or engine rotates"},{"t":20.1,"txt":"and drives the shaft in the pump or other driven machine."},{"t":26.3,"txt":"Misalignment of the shafts puts strain"},{"t":28.7,"txt":"on both the motor and the pump."},{"t":31,"txt":"It can damage the bearings, couplings,"},{"t":33,"txt":"and other machine components."},{"t":35.7,"txt":"For this reason, manufacturers of rotating equipment"},{"t":38.8,"txt":"have established tolerances"},{"t":40.4,"txt":"that define the maximum acceptable levels of angular"},{"t":43.7,"txt":"and offset misalignment for their machines."},{"t":48.3,"txt":"If two shafts are perfectly aligned,"},{"t":50.7,"txt":"they are said to be collinear."},{"t":53.3,"txt":"Collinear means that a single straight line"},{"t":55.9,"txt":"will define the center of both shafts."},{"t":58.7,"txt":"Of course, this is almost never the case in the field."},{"t":62,"txt":"Shafts are usually out of alignment"},{"t":64.7,"txt":"with the misalignment taking two forms:"},{"t":68.3,"txt":"offset misalignment,"},{"t":71.5,"txt":"and angular misalignment."},{"t":74.5,"txt":"What we typically see in the field is a combination"},{"t":77.1,"txt":"of both offset and angular misalignment,"},{"t":80.3,"txt":"occurring in three dimensions, as you can see here"},{"t":83.3,"txt":"as we rotate between the vertical plane"},{"t":85.6,"txt":"and the horizontal plane."},{"t":88.2,"txt":"While it is much easier to understand misalignment,"},{"t":91,"txt":"if you can visualize it in three-dimensional space,"},{"t":94.4,"txt":"correcting misalignment only requires that we get the shafts"},{"t":97.5,"txt":"to align in the vertical plane and in the horizontal plane."},{"t":103.2,"txt":"Fortunately, we are able to adjust the relative position"},{"t":106.5,"txt":"of the two shafts in these two dimensions."},{"t":110,"txt":"We can raise or lower the movable machine"},{"t":112.8,"txt":"in the vertical plane, and we can move it side to side"},{"t":117.5,"txt":"in the horizontal plane."},{"t":121.3,"txt":"If we get the shafts aligned in these two dimensions"},{"t":123.9,"txt":"or planes, they will then be intolerant"},{"t":127.2,"txt":"and close to collinear."},{"t":134.2,"txt":"The challenge of precision alignment"},{"t":136.1,"txt":"can therefore be defined as first,"},{"t":139.1,"txt":"measuring misalignment in the horizontal"},{"t":141.2,"txt":"and vertical planes."},{"t":143.2,"txt":"Second, calculating the moves required"},{"t":146.3,"txt":"to correct the misalignment,"},{"t":148.7,"txt":"and finally, making the prescribed adjustments."},{"t":154,"txt":"Subscribe to our channel to learn more"},{"t":156,"txt":"with our Shaft Alignment 101 series."},{"t":158.7,"txt":"We will explore alignment topics such as offset,"},{"t":161.5,"txt":"angularity, run-out, and more."}],"words":[{"t":5.76,"w":"-"},{"t":5.76,"w":"[Narrator]"},{"t":5.76,"w":"All"},{"t":5.76,"w":"around"},{"t":5.76,"w":"the"},{"t":5.76,"w":"world,"},{"t":7.11,"w":"millions"},{"t":7.11,"w":"of"},{"t":7.11,"w":"motors"},{"t":7.11,"w":"are"},{"t":7.11,"w":"coupled"},{"t":8.91,"w":"to"},{"t":8.91,"w":"millions"},{"t":8.91,"w":"of"},{"t":8.91,"w":"machines."},{"t":11.61,"w":"Additionally,"},{"t":11.61,"w":"there"},{"t":11.61,"w":"are"},{"t":11.61,"w":"many"},{"t":11.61,"w":"other"},{"t":11.61,"w":"examples"},{"t":13.98,"w":"of"},{"t":13.98,"w":"rotating"},{"t":13.98,"w":"equipment"},{"t":13.98,"w":"that"},{"t":13.98,"w":"require"},{"t":13.98,"w":"shaft"},{"t":13.98,"w":"alignment."},{"t":17.58,"w":"The"},{"t":17.58,"w":"shaft"},{"t":17.58,"w":"and"},{"t":17.58,"w":"the"},{"t":17.58,"w":"motor"},{"t":17.58,"w":"or"},{"t"